├── DCCircuit.h / .cpp          <-- DC engine (Operating Point & Parameter Sweeps)
├── ACCircuit.h / .cpp          <-- AC frequency domain parser & Bode matrix generator
├── PulseCircuit.h / .cpp       <-- Time-domain microsecond transient tracker
└── main.cpp                    <-- Core manager & dynamic router execution file


